See cpp11_variadic_pack_element_under_cast for the header-free form.
--unwind 257: libstdc++'s __from_chars_alnum_to_val_table<false> is built
at run time by loops of 256, 10 and 26 iterations; a lower bound made the
end of main unreachable.
